EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
CarbonTally presents a highly viable commercial opportunity in the UK, Ireland, and EU markets, primarily due to its hybrid "AI + Human-in-the-Loop" (Managed Data Entry) architecture. While the carbon accounting software market is crowded at the enterprise level (Watershed, Persefoni), a massive "missing middle" exists: mid-market companies (50–500 employees) facing downstream CSRD/Scope 3 data requests but lacking the resources for $40K+/year enterprise platforms or the clean data required by pure-play SaaS tools.
CarbonTally’s MVP directly solves the #1 industry bottleneck: messy, unstructured operational data (PDFs, invoices, CSVs). By combining OCR extraction with a managed human-validation service, CarbonTally bridges the gap between raw financial/operational data and audit-ready DEFRA/ESRS calculations.
Investment Verdict: Strong Buy / Fundable. High probability of reaching £10M ARR (75% confidence) within 3–4 years with focused mid-market GTM. Probability of £100M ARR is moderate (35% confidence) and requires subsequent expansion into automated Scope 3 supply chain APIs and enterprise tiers.
