"Audit-Ready Carbon Accounting, Without the Data Engineering Headache."
The hybrid model (AI OCR + Human Validation + Interactive Correction) guarantees data accuracy for companies that lack internal sustainability data teams. It is a "SaaS-enabled Managed Service" (SEMS).
