Threat of New Entrants: Medium. AI OCR is commoditized, but building the curated emission factor mapping and human validation workflow takes domain expertise.
Bargaining Power of Buyers: Medium-High. Mid-market buyers are price-sensitive and have many low-cost alternatives (Greenly, spreadsheets).
